stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Syncing : Trigger Sync Job
    Syncing --> Completed : Data Fetched
    Syncing --> Failed : API Error
    Completed --> Idle : Return to Idle
    Failed --> RetryScheduled : Schedule Retry
    RetryScheduled --> Syncing : Retry Timeout
    RetryScheduled --> Failed : Max Retries Exceeded

    note right of Idle
        Waiting for next scheduled sync
    end note

    note right of Syncing
        Fetching data from Google Fit API
    end note

    note right of Completed
        Data stored, ready for ML analysis
    end note

    note right of Failed
        Initial sync error, schedule retry
    end note

    note right of RetryScheduled
        Exponential backoff retry scheduled
    end note